{"id": "./", "name": "INDIA — 5 JOURNEYS", "short_name": "IN/5", "lang": "ja", "dir": "ltr", "description": "日本在住の大学生に向けて、インド国内の旅行先5地域を「文化・自然・コスパ・アクセス・安心・食・体験・写真映え」の8軸で多元的に評価。デリー＆アーグラ、ジャイプル、バラナシ、ケーララ、ラダックを本物の写真とともに紹介します。", "start_url": "./", "scope": "./", "display": "fullscreen", "display_override": ["fullscreen", "standalone"], "orientation": "landscape", "background_color": "#0d0b0a", "theme_color": "#0d0b0a", "icons": [{"src": "og/icon-192.png", "sizes": "192x192", "type": "image/png"}, {"src": "og/icon-512.png", "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png"}, {"src": "og/icon-maskable-512.png", "sizes": "512x512", "type": "image/png", "purpose": "maskable"}]}